Z||000000||Vlad||10-27-2000||09:28 PM||||Hello all.<P>Well. What I did was a swap of passenger seat with driver seat. <BR>The major problem of that swap is a tilting mechanism. The bottom parts of the seats was a direct bolt on. All I had to do was just pop the side of the seat to get to the holes.<BR>Also, the is one clip on each bottom seat that has to be put on opposite side of the seat.<P>The upper side needs modifications. Not much though.....   (I didn't swap upper part beacause mine were fine.)<BR>Two holes have to be drilled on outer side of the upper part and treads have to be made inside them. <BR>I think that's all.<BR>||||reg||14
